### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Test User","email":"test@example.com","password":"password123"}

### Register again (should fail with 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Test User","email":"test@example.com","password":"password123"}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"test@example.com","password":"password123"}

### Login with wrong password (should fail with 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"test@example.com","password":"wrongpassword"}

### List doctors
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors

### Filter by specialty and city
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors?specialty=Cardiology&city=Bengaluru

### Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors?page=2&limit=5

### Free slots for doctor 1 (use tomorrow's date)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors/1/slots?date=2026-11-23

### Bad date (should fail with 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors/1/slots?date=abc

### Login (send this first)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"test@example.com","password":"password123"}

### Book slot 1
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"slotId": 2}

### Book slot 1 again (should fail with 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"slotId": 1}

### My appointments
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel appointment 1
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Book without a token (should fail with 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"slotId": 1}

### Filter lists
GET http://localhost:3000/api/meta

### One doctor
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors/1

### Doctor not found (should be 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors/99999

### Who am I (send Login first)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctor login
# @name doctorLogin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"arjun.pandey@medislot.com","password":"Password123"}

### Doctor creates slots (expect 201, created: 4)
@doctorToken = {{doctorLogin.response.body.token}}
POST http://localhost:3000/api/portal/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{"date":"2026-11-30","startTime":"14:00","endTime":"16:00","durationMinutes":30}

### Same request again (expect created: 0)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/portal/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{"date":"2026-11-30","startTime":"14:00","endTime":"16:00","durationMinutes":30}

### Doctor's slots that day
GET http://localhost:3000/api/portal/slots?date=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### Doctor's appointments
GET http://localhost:3000/api/portal/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@medislot.com","password":"Admin1234"}

### Admin stats
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin lookups
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/lookups
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin adds a clinic
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/clinics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"name":"Lakeside Clinic","city":"Bengaluru","address":"12 Lake Road"}

### Admin adds a doctor
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/doctors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"name":"Dr. Asha Rao","email":"asha@medislot.com","password":"Password123","specialtyId":1,"clinicId":1,"experienceYears":8,"consultationFee":600}